 {"id":"DF-SPECLANG-014","status":"complete","priority":"P2","type":"bug","complexity":3,"title":"P0 pipeline executor module missing from daemon.spec.dir tree - daemon cascade can never generate; plus 30s infinite recascade on permanent failure (DF-SPECLANG-2-R5 live repro)","reasoning":"LIVE REPRO 2026-11-16 (agent-driver baseline test, trilogy2 project): daemon detected the injected spec, convergence fired every 30s but every cycle logged: Pipeline execution error: Cannot find module /home/kara/speclang/specs/daemon.spec.dir/pipeline/executor.js imported from specs/daemon.spec.dir/src/daemon.ts - then Auto-recascade enabled - arming for next cascade, looping indefinitely with Files: 0 and Cascade complete false-success messages. Confirms DF-SPECLANG-2-R5 (never idles) and adds the root cause candidate: the executor module is absent from the spec tree the generated daemon imports from.","acceptance_criteria":"Expected outcome: with the repo built via npm run build, start the daemon plus coordinator against a scratch project whose specs directory gains a new .spec.md file; the run must return exit 0 with no 'Cannot find module' error for the pipeline executor, at least one non-empty generated file on disk, and the daemon must reach idle within 60 seconds of the last event. For the backoff half: break the executor deliberately, rerun the same scenario, and expect zero consecutive recascade cycles after the third failure plus status idle in the daemon state file. Proof: both daemon logs and the state file contents go in the row evidence.","detail":{"metadata":{},"fingerprint":"97fe99a4439ae1f025ac3b782f5dcbb14698a674be1d62e874118b5685d4a144","evidence":[{"run_id":"DF-SPECLANG-014","ts":"2026-11-16T19:07:39.981422+00:00"}]},"capability_tags":[],"created_at":"2026-11-16T17:15:20.595891+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T19:07:39.981422+00:00","foreman_note":"FIXED 2026-11-16 (agent, live-verified). Root causes: (1) specs/daemon.spec.dir/src/daemon.ts lazily imported '../p